.TH LIBUTF8_REPLACEMENT_CHARACTER_UTF8 3 LIBUTF8
.SH NAME
LIBUTF8_REPLACEMENT_CHARACTER_UTF8 - Unicode replacement character encoded as UTF-8

.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include <libutf8.h>

#define \fBLIBUTF8_REPLACEMENT_CHARACTER_UTF8\fP /* implementation omitted */
.fi

.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B LIBUTF8_REPLACEMENT_CHARACTER_UTF8
macro expands to a string literal containing the UTF-8 encoding
of U+FFFD REPLACEMENT CHARACTER.

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR libutf8 (7),
.BR LIBUTF8_REPLACEMENT_CHARACTER_CODEPOINT (3),
.BR LIBUTF8_REPLACE_INVALID (3)
